<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
<meta name="description" content="TIKVARON CBOS business systems inventory, maturity scoring and ownership register.">
<title>TIKVARON | Business Systems Register</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0d1713;--panel:#13221b;--panel2:#192b22;--panel3:#20372b;
  --gold:#d7ad57;--gold2:#f0d58d;--green:#76bd8a;--green2:#b8e0bd;
  --cream:#f1eee4;--muted:#9aa99d;--line:#2b4034;--line2:#3c5646;
  --red:#e8756d;--orange:#e9a45c;--blue:#80b6e8;--purple:#c2a0e8;
  --shadow:0 18px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.24);--radius:14px;
  --sans:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  --mono:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,monospace;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% -10%,rgba(215,173,87,.10),transparent 32%),var(--bg);color:var(--cream);font:14px/1.5 var(--sans);}
button,input,select{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:2px}
.shell{max-width:1900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px 96px}
.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:30;background:rgba(13,23,19,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(18px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin:0;padding:13px 28px}
.topbar-inner{max-width:1844px;margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-width:220px}.brand-mark{width:38px;height:38px;border:1px solid rgba(215,173,87,.55);border-radius:11px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--gold);font-weight:900;font-size:17px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(215,173,87,.18),rgba(118,189,138,.07));}
.brand h1{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;font-weight:850}.brand p{margin:2px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font:10px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}
.header-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.storage-state{font:11px var(--mono);color:var(--green2);padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(118,189,138,.07);white-space:nowrap}.storage-state.warn{color:var(--orange);border-color:rgba(233,164,92,.35)}
.btn{border:1px solid var(--line2);background:var(--panel);color:var(--cream);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 13px;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;transition:.15s}.btn:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold2);transform:translateY(-1px)}.btn.primary{background:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold);color:#182017}.btn.primary:hover{background:var(--gold2);color:#182017}.btn.ghost{background:transparent}.btn.small{padding:6px 9px;font-size:11px}
.hero{padding:28px 0 17px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.eyebrow{font:10px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:7px}.hero h2{font-size:clamp(23px,3vw,34px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:0;font-weight:800}.hero p{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted);max-width:760px;font-size:13px}.hero-note{border-left:2px solid var(--gold);padding:8px 12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;max-width:330px}.hero-note strong{color:var(--gold2);font-weight:650}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:11px;margin:12px 0 17px}.stat{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(25,43,34,.98),rgba(19,34,27,.98));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:15px 16px;min-height:94px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.stat-label{font:10px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}.stat-value{font-size:25px;font-weight:800;margin-top:5px;letter-spacing:-.04em;color:var(--gold2);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.stat-sub{margin-top:1px;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}
.maturity-overview{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(180px,1.1fr) 2fr;gap:20px;align-items:center}.maturity-overview h3{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 3px}.maturity-overview p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.distribution{display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:center;height:13px}.distribution span{height:100%;min-width:2px;border-radius:99px}.dist-0{background:#75847a}.dist-1{background:var(--red)}.dist-2{background:var(--orange)}.dist-3{background:var(--blue)}.dist-4{background:var(--green)}.distribution-legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:7px;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}.legend-item{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}.legend-dot{height:7px;width:7px;border-radius:99px;display:inline-block}
.toolbar{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:13px;margin-bottom:13px}.toolbar-row{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.search{position:relative;flex:1;min-width:220px}.search input{width:100%;background:#0f1b15;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:9px;color:var(--cream);padding:10px 12px 10px 36px;font-size:12px}.search:before{content:"⌕";position:absolute;left:12px;top:5px;color:var(--gold);font-size:21px}.filter{background:#0f1b15;border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--cream);border-radius:9px;padding:10px 30px 10px 10px;font-size:11px;max-width:190px}.filter option{background:#13221b}.filter-label{font:9px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}.quick-filters{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:11px}.stage-chip{border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);padding:6px 10px;font:10px var(--mono);transition:.15s}.stage-chip:hover{color:var(--cream);border-color:var(--gold)}.stage-chip.active{background:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold);color:#1a211a;font-weight:800}.filter-summary{margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font:10px var(--mono)}
.workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:245px minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;align-items:start}.sidebar{position:sticky;top:85px;max-height:calc(100vh - 105px);overflow:auto;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:12px 0}.side-head{padding:2px 14px 11px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font:10px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}.cat-nav{list-style:none;padding:6px 0;margin:0}.cat-nav button{width:100%;border:0;background:transparent;color:#c0cbbf;text-align:left;padding:7px 13px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:11px;line-height:1.3}.cat-nav button:hover{background:var(--panel2);color:var(--gold2)}.cat-nav button.active{background:rgba(215,173,87,.12);color:var(--gold2);box-shadow:inset 2px 0 var(--gold)}.cat-number{font:10px var(--mono);color:#748579;width:22px;flex:none}.cat-name{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;flex:1}.cat-count{font:9px var(--mono);background:var(--panel3);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:20px;color:var(--muted)}
.content{min-width:0}.content-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:2px 0 10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.content-top h3{margin:0;font-size:13px}.content-top p{margin:3px 0 0;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.table-actions{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.section{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);margin-bottom:11px;overflow:hidden}.section-head{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-align:left;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(215,173,87,.08),transparent 60%);padding:12px 14px;border:0;color:var(--cream)}.section-head:hover{background:rgba(215,173,87,.10)}.section-index{font:11px var(--mono);color:var(--gold)}.section-name{font-size:12px;font-weight:750}.section-meta{margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font:10px var(--mono)}.section-chevron{color:var(--gold);font-size:13px}.table-wrap{overflow:auto;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:900px}thead th{font:9px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase;text-align:left;color:var(--muted);background:#14241b;padding:10px 11px;white-space:nowrap;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2}tbody tr{border-top:1px solid rgba(43,64,52,.6)}tbody tr:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.018)}tbody td{padding:9px 11px;vertical-align:middle}.sys-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;min-width:185px}.sys-desc{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);min-width:220px;max-width:280px}.cell-select,.owner-input{width:100%;background:#0f1b15;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:7px 8px;color:var(--cream);font-size:10px;min-width:112px}.cell-select{cursor:pointer}.owner-input{min-width:125px}.owner-input::placeholder{color:#718277}.cell-select:hover,.owner-input:hover{border-color:var(--line2)}.maturity-cell{min-width:165px}.maturity-select{width:145px}.score-line{font:9px var(--mono);color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}.score-value{color:var(--gold2);font-weight:700}.pill{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--line2);padding:3px 7px;border-radius:99px;font:9px var(--mono);white-space:nowrap}.priority-Critical{color:#ffaaa4;border-color:rgba(232,117,109,.38);background:rgba(232,117,109,.08)}.priority-High{color:#f0bd80;border-color:rgba(233,164,92,.32);background:rgba(233,164,92,.07)}.priority-Medium{color:#9ec9ed;border-color:rgba(128,182,232,.3);background:rgba(128,182,232,.07)}.priority-Low{color:#aebdb1;border-color:rgba(154,169,157,.25);background:rgba(154,169,157,.06)}.empty{border:1px dashed var(--line2);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:48px 20px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}.empty strong{display:block;color:var(--cream);font-size:16px;margin-bottom:5px}
.footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:25px;padding:14px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.footer strong{color:var(--gold2);font-weight:650}.toast{position:fixed;right:20px;bottom:20px;z-index:100;background:#20372b;border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--cream);padding:11px 14px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);font-size:12px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);pointer-events:none;transition:.2s}.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}
@media(max-width:1120px){.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.workspace{grid-template-columns:200px minmax(0,1fr)}}@media(max-width:820px){.shell{padding:0 14px 85px}.topbar{margin:0;padding:11px 14px}.workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sidebar{position:static;max-height:250px}.cat-nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.maturity-overview{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}.hero{padding-top:22px}.hero-note{max-width:none}}@media(max-width:560px){.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.stat{min-height:82px;padding:12px}.stat-value{font-size:21px}.header-actions{width:100%}.header-actions .btn{flex:1}.storage-state{order:3;width:100%;text-align:center}.toolbar-row>*{max-width:none}.filter{flex:1;min-width:calc(50% - 8px)}.search{min-width:100%}.cat-nav{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media print{body{background:#fff;color:#111}.topbar,.toolbar,.sidebar,.table-actions,.footer,.toast{display:none!important}.shell{max-width:none;padding:0}.workspace{display:block}.section{break-inside:avoid;background:white;border:1px solid #ccc}.section-head{color:#111;background:#eee}thead th{position:static;background:#eee;color:#333}tbody td,.sys-desc{color:#222}.cell-select,.owner-input{border:0;background:transparent;color:#111;padding:0}.stat{background:#fff;color:#111;border:1px solid #ccc;box-shadow:none}.stat-value{color:#111}}

/* FarmVoice sponsor-validation feature */
.view-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:4px 0 18px;padding:7px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;width:max-content;max-width:100%}
.tab-btn{border:1px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 14px;font-size:11px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.03em}
.tab-btn.active{background:rgba(215,173,87,.14);border-color:rgba(215,173,87,.35);color:var(--gold2)}
#sponsorView[hidden],#systemsView[hidden]{display:none!important}
.sponsor-banner{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:18px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(215,173,87,.10),rgba(118,189,138,.04));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:15px}
.sponsor-banner h3{margin:0;font-size:17px}.sponsor-banner p{margin:5px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;max-width:760px}
.gate-status{border:1px solid rgba(233,164,92,.4);background:rgba(233,164,92,.08);color:#f0bd80;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 10px;font:10px var(--mono);white-space:nowrap}
.sponsor-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px;margin:0 0 14px}
.sponsor-stat{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:12px}.sponsor-stat b{display:block;font-size:20px;color:var(--gold2)}.sponsor-stat span{font:9px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.sponsor-toolbar{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:11px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:13px}
.sponsor-toolbar input,.sponsor-toolbar select{background:#0f1b15;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:8px;color:var(--cream);padding:9px 10px;font-size:11px;min-width:145px}.sponsor-toolbar input{flex:1;min-width:220px}
.prospect-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}
.prospect-card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;padding:14px;min-width:0}
.prospect-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start}.prospect-country{font:9px var(--mono);color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase}.prospect-card h4{font-size:15px;margin:4px 0 5px}.prospect-card .evidence-note{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px}
.qualification{border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:99px;padding:4px 8px;font:9px var(--mono);white-space:nowrap}.q-high{color:var(--green2);border-color:rgba(118,189,138,.4);background:rgba(118,189,138,.08)}.q-medium{color:#f0bd80;border-color:rgba(233,164,92,.4);background:rgba(233,164,92,.08)}.q-low{color:#ffaaa4;border-color:rgba(232,117,109,.4);background:rgba(232,117,109,.08)}
.score-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin:9px 0 12px}.score-number{font-size:21px;font-weight:850;color:var(--gold2);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.score-caption{font:9px var(--mono);color:var(--muted)}.score-track{height:6px;flex:1;background:#263a2e;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}.score-fill{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--orange),var(--green));border-radius:99px}
.prospect-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin:10px 0}.prospect-fields label,.rubric-grid label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;color:var(--muted);font:9px var(--mono);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}.prospect-fields input,.prospect-fields select,.prospect-fields textarea,.rubric-grid select{width:100%;background:#0e1a14;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:7px;color:var(--cream);padding:7px 8px;font:10px var(--sans);min-width:0;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal}.prospect-fields textarea{min-height:53px;resize:vertical;grid-column:1/-1}
.prospect-card details{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px}.prospect-card summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--gold2);font-size:10px;font-weight:750}.detail-block{margin:9px 0}.detail-block strong{display:block;color:var(--cream);font-size:10px;margin-bottom:3px}.detail-block p{color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;margin:0;line-height:1.55}.detail-block a{color:var(--green2);text-decoration:none}.detail-block a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.rubric-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px;margin:10px 0}.rubric-title{font:9px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin:13px 0 6px}
.sponsor-checklist{margin-top:15px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px}.sponsor-checklist h4{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 8px}.sponsor-checklist ol{padding-left:19px;margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}.sponsor-checklist li{margin:5px 0}.sponsor-checklist strong{color:var(--cream)}
.sponsor-empty{grid-column:1/-1;border:1px dashed var(--line2);border-radius:12px;padding:30px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
@media(max-width:820px){.prospect-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sponsor-stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.view-tabs{width:100%}.tab-btn{flex:1}}
@media(max-width:480px){.prospect-fields,.rubric-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.prospect-fields textarea{grid-column:auto}.sponsor-toolbar input{min-width:100%}}


/* Expanded portfolio operating controls */
#decisionFilter{min-width:145px}
.manage-btn{padding:6px 8px;font-size:10px}
.system-modal{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:1000;background:rgba(4,10,7,.78);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:20px}
.system-modal[hidden]{display:none!important}
.system-modal-panel{width:min(760px,100%);max-height:min(90vh,900px);overflow:auto;background:#122219;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 25px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.55)}
.modal-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;margin-bottom:14px}.modal-head h3{font-size:18px;margin:0}.modal-head p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:5px 0 0}
.system-modal-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.system-modal-grid label,.calc-inputs label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.system-modal-grid input,.system-modal-grid select,.system-modal-grid textarea,.calc-inputs input{background:#0b1811;color:var(--cream);border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:8px;padding:9px;font:11px var(--sans);width:100%}.system-modal-grid textarea{resize:vertical}.span-2{grid-column:span 2}.modal-actions{grid-column:span 2;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-top:4px}
.ops-banner{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(215,173,87,.12),rgba(118,189,138,.05));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;margin:18px 0}.ops-banner h3{font-size:19px;margin:0}.ops-banner p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);max-width:760px;margin:7px 0 0}.ops-lock{max-width:290px;border:1px solid rgba(232,117,109,.4);background:rgba(232,117,109,.07);border-radius:10px;padding:11px}.ops-lock strong{display:block;color:#ffaaa4;font:11px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.07em}.ops-lock span{display:block;margin-top:5px;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}
.ops-kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px}.ops-kpi{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:13px}.ops-kpi b{display:block;font-size:23px;color:var(--gold2)}.ops-kpi span{font:9px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.ops-section{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin:0 0 14px}.ops-section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px}.ops-section-head h3{font-size:15px;margin:0}.ops-section-head p{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin:5px 0 0}.ops-head-actions{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.starter-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}.starter-card{background:#102017;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px}.starter-card h4{font-size:11px;margin:0 0 5px}.starter-card p{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 8px}.starter-meta{font:9px var(--mono);color:var(--gold2)}
.add-action-form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1.3fr 1fr .9fr auto;gap:7px;margin:0 0 12px}.add-action-form input,.add-action-form select{background:#0b1811;color:var(--cream);border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:8px;padding:9px;font-size:10px;min-width:0}.ops-task-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}.ops-task{background:#102017;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;min-width:0}.ops-task-top{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.ops-task h4{font-size:11px;margin:0}.ops-task small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font:9px var(--mono);margin-top:4px}.ops-task-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px;margin-top:10px}.ops-task-fields label{font:9px var(--mono);color:var(--muted);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.ops-task-fields input,.ops-task-fields select,.ops-task-fields textarea{width:100%;background:#0b1811;color:var(--cream);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:7px;font-size:10px;min-width:0}.ops-task-fields textarea{grid-column:span 2;resize:vertical;min-height:48px}.task-delete{border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}.task-delete:hover{color:var(--red)}
.calc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:15px}.calc-inputs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}.calc-results{background:#0e1c14;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:13px}.calc-readiness{font:10px var(--mono);color:var(--orange);padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:8px}.calc-result{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(43,64,52,.5);font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.calc-result strong{color:var(--gold2);font:700 13px var(--mono);text-align:right}.calc-results p{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;margin:10px 0}
.stage-roadmap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}.stage-roadmap article{background:#102017;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px}.stage-roadmap h4{font-size:11px;margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--gold2)}.stage-roadmap ul{padding-left:16px;margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}.stage-roadmap li{margin:6px 0}.governance-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}.governance-grid div{background:#102017;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px}.governance-grid strong{font-size:11px}.governance-grid p{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0}
@media(max-width:1050px){.stage-roadmap{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.governance-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.add-action-form{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.add-action-form input:first-child{grid-column:span 2}}
@media(max-width:700px){.ops-kpis{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.starter-grid,.ops-task-list,.calc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.calc-inputs{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.stage-roadmap{grid-template-columns:1fr}.governance-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.system-modal-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.span-2,.modal-actions{grid-column:span 1}.add-action-form{grid-template-columns:1fr}.add-action-form input:first-child{grid-column:auto}.ops-banner{padding:13px}}


/* Partnership & ownership governance */
.partner-banner{background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(118,189,138,.12),rgba(215,173,87,.08));border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px;margin:14px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}.partner-banner h3{margin:2px 0 5px;font-size:20px}.partner-banner p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);max-width:850px;font-size:12px}.partner-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:11px;margin:13px 0}.partner-card,.partner-panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:15px}.partner-card h4,.partner-panel h4{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:12px;color:var(--gold2)}.partner-card p,.partner-panel p,.partner-panel li{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.partner-panel{margin:12px 0}.partner-panel ul,.partner-panel ol{padding-left:19px;margin:8px 0}.partner-panel li{margin:5px 0}.partner-form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.partner-form label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}.partner-form input,.partner-form select,.partner-form textarea{width:100%;background:#0f1b15;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:8px;padding:9px;color:var(--cream);font-size:11px}.partner-form textarea{min-height:66px;resize:vertical}.partner-form .wide{grid-column:1/-1}.partner-checks{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;grid-column:1/-1;padding:9px;background:#0f1b15;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}.partner-checks label{display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:6px}.partner-checks input{width:auto}.partner-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin:12px 0}.partner-table-wrap{overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}.partner-table{min-width:920px}.partner-table td{font-size:10px}.partner-status{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--line2);padding:3px 7px;border-radius:20px;font:9px var(--mono);white-space:nowrap}.partner-note{border-left:2px solid var(--gold);padding:9px 12px;background:rgba(215,173,87,.06);color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;margin:10px 0}.partner-danger{border-left-color:var(--red);background:rgba(232,117,109,.06)}
@media(max-width:900px){.partner-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:620px){.partner-grid,.partner-form{grid-template-columns:1fr}.partner-form .wide,.partner-checks{grid-column:auto}}

</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="topbar">
  <div class="topbar-inner">
    <div class="brand"><div class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">T</div><div><h1>TIKVARON</h1><p>CBOS / Business Systems Register</p></div></div>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <span class="storage-state" id="storageState" role="status">● Local workspace</span>
      <button class="btn" id="backupBtn" type="button">Backup JSON</button>
      <button class="btn" id="restoreBtn" type="button">Restore backup</button>
      <input class="sr-only" type="file" id="restoreFile" accept="application/json,.json">
      <button class="btn primary" id="exportBtn" type="button">Export filtered CSV</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<main class="shell">
  <section class="hero">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">Operating control / capability inventory</div><h2>Business Systems Register</h2><p>Search and manage the expanded 100-category portfolio: score maturity, assign owners, set Build/Buy/Defer/Kill, capture monthly cost, dependencies and review triggers, and run the current operating plan. Your edits stay in this browser unless you export a backup.</p></div>
    <div class="hero-note"><strong>Assessment rule</strong><br>Unrated means not yet assessed. Assign a maturity level only when you have evidence for it.</div>
  </section>
  <nav class="view-tabs" aria-label="Business operating views">
    <button class="tab-btn active" type="button" data-view="systems">Business Systems Register</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" type="button" data-view="sponsors">FarmVoice Sponsor Validation</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" type="button" data-view="operations">Operating Cockpit</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" type="button" data-view="partnerships">Partnership & Ownership</button>
  </nav>
  <div id="systemsView">
  <section class="stats" aria-label="Register summary">
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">Systems in register</div><div class="stat-value" id="statSystems">—</div><div class="stat-sub">1,171 capabilities after merging five source rounds</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">Categories</div><div class="stat-value" id="statCategories">—</div><div class="stat-sub">Business capability groups</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">Maturity score</div><div class="stat-value" id="statMaturity">—</div><div class="stat-sub" id="statMaturitySub">No systems assessed</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">Owners assigned</div><div class="stat-value" id="statOwners">—</div><div class="stat-sub" id="statOwnersSub">No owners assigned</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-label">Critical priority</div><div class="stat-value" id="statCritical">—</div><div class="stat-sub">Across full inventory</div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="maturity-overview" aria-label="Maturity distribution">
    <div><h3>Maturity distribution</h3><p id="maturitySummary">No maturity scores entered yet. Score each system from 0 to 4.</p></div>
    <div><div class="distribution" id="distribution"><span style="width:100%;background:#526357"></span></div><div class="distribution-legend" id="distributionLegend"></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="toolbar" aria-label="Search and filters">
    <div class="toolbar-row">
      <label class="search"><span class="sr-only">Search register</span><input id="searchInput" type="search" placeholder="Search systems, descriptions, categories or owners…" autocomplete="off"></label>
      <label><span class="sr-only">Filter by stage</span><select class="filter" id="stageFilter"><option value="">All stages</option></select></label>
      <label><span class="sr-only">Filter by priority</span><select class="filter" id="priorityFilter"><option value="">All priorities</option><option>Critical</option><option>High</option><option>Medium</option><option>Low</option><option>Unassigned</option></select></label>
      <label><span class="sr-only">Filter by maturity</span><select class="filter" id="maturityFilter"><option value="">All maturity levels</option><option value="unrated">Unrated</option><option value="0">Not Started</option><option value="1">Ad hoc</option><option value="2">Defined</option><option value="3">Managed</option><option value="4">Optimized</option></select></label>
      <label><span class="sr-only">Filter by owner</span><select class="filter" id="ownerFilter"><option value="">All owners</option><option value="assigned">Assigned</option><option value="unassigned">Unassigned</option></select></label>
      <label><span class="sr-only">Filter by operating decision</span><select class="filter" id="decisionFilter"><option value="">All decisions</option><option>Unassessed</option><option>Build</option><option>Buy</option><option>Defer</option><option>Kill</option></select></label>
      <button class="btn ghost" id="resetBtn" type="button">Reset filters</button>
    </div>
    <div class="quick-filters"><span class="filter-label">Company stage</span><div id="stageChips" class="quick-filters" style="margin:0"></div><span class="filter-summary" id="filterSummary">Showing all systems</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="workspace">
    <aside class="sidebar"><div class="side-head">Categories <span id="sidebarCount"></span></div><nav><ul class="cat-nav" id="catNav"></ul></nav></aside>
    <div class="content">
      <div class="content-top"><div><h3 id="contentTitle">All business systems</h3><p id="contentSubtitle">Edit stage, priority, maturity and accountable owner in the table.</p></div><div class="table-actions"><button class="btn small" id="expandBtn" type="button">Expand all</button><button class="btn small" id="collapseBtn" type="button">Collapse all</button><button class="btn small" id="exportAllBtn" type="button">Export full CSV</button></div></div>
      <div id="contentArea" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  </div>
  <section id="sponsorView" hidden aria-label="FarmVoice sponsor validation">
    <div class="sponsor-banner">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">Commercial validation / build gate</div><h3>FarmVoice Paid-Pilot Sponsor Gate</h3><p>Research snapshot: 16 November 2026. Five shortlisted institutions. The purpose is to verify a real payer, an authorised decision-maker, an available budget route and a viable farmer cohort before product development expands.</p></div>
      <span class="gate-status">NO PAID SPONSOR VERIFIED · BUILD GATED</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sponsor-stats">
      <div class="sponsor-stat"><b id="sponsorTotal">5</b><span>Shortlisted prospects</span></div>
      <div class="sponsor-stat"><b id="sponsorHigh">0</b><span>High qualification</span></div>
      <div class="sponsor-stat"><b id="sponsorBudget">0</b><span>Budget verified</span></div>
      <div class="sponsor-stat"><b id="sponsorPaid">0</b><span>Paid sponsors confirmed</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sponsor-toolbar">
      <input id="prospectSearch" type="search" placeholder="Search organisation, country, decision role, budget route…" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Search sponsor prospects">
      <select id="prospectCountry"><option value="">All countries</option><option>Kenya</option><option>India</option><option>Ghana</option><option>Nigeria</option></select>
      <select id="prospectStage"><option value="">All deal stages</option></select>
      <select id="prospectQualification"><option value="">All qualification levels</option><option>High</option><option>Medium</option><option>Low</option></select>
      <select id="prospectOwner"><option value="">All owners</option><option value="assigned">Owner assigned</option><option value="unassigned">Unassigned</option></select>
      <button class="btn ghost" id="prospectReset" type="button">Reset</button>
      <button class="btn small" id="prospectBackup" type="button">Backup tracker</button>
      <button class="btn small" id="prospectRestore" type="button">Restore tracker</button>
      <input class="sr-only" type="file" id="prospectRestoreFile" accept="application/json,.json">
      <button class="btn primary" id="prospectExport" type="button">Export sponsor CSV</button>
    </div>
    <div id="prospectCards" class="prospect-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div class="sponsor-checklist">
      <h4>Evidence required to unlock product development</h4>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Authorised sponsor:</strong> a named person can approve the pilot or formally sponsor it through procurement.</li>
        <li><strong>Budget:</strong> a current, identified budget or funding source can pay TIKVARON; broad programme funding is not enough.</li>
        <li><strong>Paid intent:</strong> written approval, signed scope/contract or purchase order, and agreed payment terms. Verbal enthusiasm is not a sale.</li>
        <li><strong>Farmer cohort:</strong> an organisation commits access to a defined 100–150 farmer group, local coordinator and selected crop/geography.</li>
        <li><strong>Agronomy and safety:</strong> a qualified human approves source content, reviews high-risk questions and receives escalations.</li>
      </ol>
      <div class="detail-block"><strong>Proposed pilot shape — not yet a commitment</strong><p>12 weeks · 100–150 farmers · one network and geography · up to two crops · WhatsApp voice first · approved agronomy content · human escalation · monthly usage and quality reporting. A fixed fee will be quoted only after delivery costs, cohort and service scope are known. Do not offer a free pilot.</p></div>
      <div class="detail-block"><strong>Outreach activity</strong><p><strong>16 November 2026 — CGA inquiry sent.</strong> A non-binding paid-pilot discovery email was sent to <a href="mailto:info@cga.co.ke">info@cga.co.ke</a>. Subject: “Exploring a paid, limited FarmVoice pilot with CGA”. It requests the right programme contact, a check on whether a current budget could support a paid pilot, procurement requirements and a suitable farmer cohort. <strong>Status: sent; awaiting response.</strong> FIPS Africa and Samunnati have not been contacted; they remain next-in-sequence prospects pending CGA acknowledgement and the response/sequence decision.</p></div><div class="detail-block"><strong>Current gate</strong><p>No paid sponsor commitment, confirmed procurement budget or farmer cohort has been verified. Keep FarmVoice product development gated. This tracker records research and sponsor-validation activity; it does not send messages or create agreements.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="partnershipsView" hidden aria-label="TIKVARON partnership and ownership governance">
    <div class="partner-banner"><div><div class="eyebrow">Company governance / founder control</div><h3>Partnership & Ownership Governance</h3><p>Company-wide policy for every proposed relationship, including technology providers, agricultural knowledge partners, distribution partners, commercial sponsors, accelerators, investors and joint development collaborators. The central register distinguishes sent inquiries from uncontacted research prospects.</p></div><span class="gate-status">COLLABORATE WITHOUT SURRENDERING OWNERSHIP</span></div>
    <div class="partner-note"><strong>Policy status: Founder-approved operating principle · 16 November 2026.</strong> This is an internal governance policy and decision-control framework. It is not legal advice and does not replace review of the actual contract under applicable law.</div>
    <div class="partner-grid">
      <article class="partner-card"><h4>1 · Company ownership</h4><p>TIKVARON retains its equity, governance, control and independent ability to choose future partners. No equity, options, warrants or control rights are offered merely for introductions